--- task
id: a02
dataset: attribution
kind: two hops from a keyed node, counted
answer: fewest

--- intent
Which sources does channel `$channel` watch, and how many touchpoints landed on each? Return the source slug and the count as `touchpoints`.

--- params
{"channel": "c1"}

--- edition2
query watched_activity($channel: String) {
  match { $ch: Channel { slug: $channel }  $ch channelWatchesSource $s  $t touchpointOnSource $s }
  return { $s.slug, count($t) as touchpoints }
}

--- edition3
query watched_activity($channel: String) {
  match { $ch: Channel { slug: $channel }  $ch channelWatchesSource $s  $t touchpointOnSource $s }
  return { $s.slug, count($t) as touchpoints }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["s.slug","touchpoints"]
["s1",4]
["s2",2]
